msgid "TextureCompressor:prop:bakeLiltoon"
msgstr "Bake color adjustments into textures"

msgid "TextureCompressor:prop:bakeLiltoon:tooltip"
msgstr "Bakes hue/saturation/gradation, active 2nd/3rd layers and the alpha mask into the main texture, and tone correction into the outline texture, at build time. Bakes with animated inputs are skipped; frozen and animation-referenced textures are never baked or consumed; excluded textures are never baked; colors remain runtime tints. Requires lilToon."

msgid "TextureCompressor:prop:removeUnused"
msgstr "Remove unused texture slots"

msgid "TextureCompressor:prop:removeUnused:tooltip"
msgstr "Clears lilToon slots whose feature toggle is off and not animated, dropping textures that become unreferenced from the upload. Frozen and animation-referenced textures are never removed. Exclusion filters do not apply here."

